# Unrooted Ancestor (3/2 flash): "{1}, Sacrifice another creature: This creature gains indestructible until end of turn. Tap it."
# Bot2's Bolt on turn 2 would kill it: Bot1 answers with an untapped Mox Emerald's {1} and the Memnite, and the Ancestor survives
# the 3 damage, tapped. The indestructible ends with the turn (CR 611.2a): on turn 4 Bot2's second Bolt kills it, and with the
# Memnite gone and the {1} there the ability is refused, since the Ancestor cannot be its own sacrifice (CR 118.3).

